# Inventory (S1)

- Hosts: `inventory/hosts.yml`; groups `hub`, `spokes`, `nested_parents`, `fleet_edge`, etc.
- Fleet-wide defaults: `inventory/group_vars/all/common.yml`.
- Hub overrides: `inventory/group_vars/hub.yml`.
- Per-host: `inventory/host_vars/<host>.yml`.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/fleet-inventory/SKILL.md`.
